00:56:22.400 --> 00:56:32.260
<v Chris Crawford>As far as the apostrophe S, I'm still not clear if you're trying to derive a specific meaning with respect to the apostrophe S.

00:56:32.260 --> 00:57:12.320
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:57:12.320 --> 00:57:17.320
